  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed front dormer by reason of its innapropriate design (siting,\r\nscale/mass, conflicting roof-form) would result in an unduly obtrusive,\r\ndisproportionate, unsympathetic and incongruous addition to the original\r\ndwellinghouse and its features (catslide roof) which would adversely impact the\r\ncharacter and appearance of the streetscene. The proposal would thereby be\r\ncontrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2024), Policy D3 (D(1) and D(11) of The London Plan (2021), Policy\r\nGR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2026) and &amp;nbsp;guidance under Harrow Councils adopted\r\nSupplementary Planning Document titled Residential Design&#x27;&amp;nbsp; (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
